{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"玛丽·居里·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"marie-curie","categoryLabel":"玛丽·居里","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.64,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/30_marie-curie/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"玛丽-居里的影响与遗产\">玛丽·居里的影响与遗产</h1><p>居里夫人的影响早已越出她生活的年代，渗入二十世纪以来科学、社会与文化的诸多层面。本卷不复述她&quot;做了什么&quot;（那属于其他卷），而专注追问一个问题：<strong>这些发现与人格，在她身后如何持续塑造世界？</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>居里夫人主题共六卷，本卷（第 5 卷·影响与遗产）在其中的定位是&quot;<strong>向后看的影响</strong>&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>她的人生历程</td>\n<td>提供本卷的传记背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>她<strong>发现了什么</strong>（放射性、镭、钋）</td>\n<td>本卷影响的&quot;源头&quot;，不重复发现过程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>她<strong>怎么做研究</strong>（测量优先、坚忍）</td>\n<td>本卷影响的&quot;方法论根&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要成就</a></td>\n<td>两次诺奖、历史第一、镭研究所创办</td>\n<td>本卷只谈这些成就<strong>如何延续</strong>，不重述其取得</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>5 影响与遗产（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>她的发现/品格<strong>身后如何持续作用</strong></td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>绯闻、辐射危害、学术评价</td>\n<td>本卷的&quot;批判性对照&quot;，避免把遗产浪漫化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>一句话边界</strong>：第 2/4 卷讲&quot;成就本身&quot;，本卷讲&quot;成就的回响&quot;；同一事实（如镭研究所的创办、两次诺奖）只在源头卷展开，本卷以相对链接引用、不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与学习路径\">三章结构与学习路径</h2><p>本卷从三个维度审视她的遗产：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><a href=\"scientific-impact/\">科学影响</a></strong> — 放射性如何成为通往原子时代、核物理（<a href=\"scientific-impact/opening-the-atomic-age\">开启原子时代</a>）与放射化学、核医学（<a href=\"scientific-impact/radiochemistry-and-nuclear-medicine\">放射化学与核医学</a>）的入口。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"social-and-gender-impact/\">社会与性别影响</a></strong> — 她如何成为<a href=\"social-and-gender-impact/an-icon-for-women-in-science\">女性投身科学的永恒象征</a>，以及<a href=\"social-and-gender-impact/the-curie-name-in-culture\">&quot;居里&quot;之名如何融入大众文化</a>。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"institutional-legacy/\">机构与人类遗产</a></strong> — 她创办的<a href=\"institutional-legacy/institutes-and-radiotherapy-today\">研究所与开创的放疗如何延续至今</a>，以及<a href=\"institutional-legacy/units-honours-and-namesakes\">以她命名的单位、元素与无数事物</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>推荐路径</strong>：若你想理解科学史脉络，按 1→2→3 顺序阅读；若你关注性别与社会议题，可直接从第 2 章进入。</p>\n<p><strong>前置建议</strong>：阅读本卷前，最好先了解她<a href=\"../core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/the-concept-of-radioactivity\">发现放射性这一概念</a>与<a href=\"../major-works/two-nobel-prizes/the-1903-physics-nobel\">两次诺贝尔奖</a>的基本事实；阅读时建议对照第 6 卷的<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/science-safety-and-myth/radiation-dangers-and-her-death\">辐射的危险与她的死亡</a>，以避免把遗产浪漫化。</p>\n<p>理解居里夫人的遗产，就是理解一位科学家如何通过发现、品格与建制，持续地塑造着她身后的世界——既包括福祉，也包括其双刃的另一面。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-impact","title":"对科学的深远影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/scientific-impact","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opening-the-atomic-age","title":"开启原子时代","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/scientific-impact/opening-the-atomic-age"},{"seq":2,"slug":"radiochemistry-and-nuclear-medicine","title":"放射化学与核医学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/scientific-impact/radiochemistry-and-nuclear-medicine"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-and-gender-impact","title":"社会与性别层面的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/social-and-gender-impact","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"an-icon-for-women-in-science","title":"女性投身科学的永恒象征","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/social-and-gender-impact/an-icon-for-women-in-science"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-curie-name-in-culture","title":"\"居里\"之名在文化中的回响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/social-and-gender-impact/the-curie-name-in-culture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"institutional-legacy","title":"制度与人类遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/institutional-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"institutes-and-radiotherapy-today","title":"研究所与今日的放射治疗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/institutional-legacy/institutes-and-radiotherapy-today"},{"seq":2,"slug":"units-honours-and-namesakes","title":"单位、荣誉与以她命名之物","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/influence-and-legacy/institutional-legacy/units-honours-and-namesakes"}]}]}